@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-token
@skillExperienceId = replace-with-skill-experience-id

### Learning panorama of the authenticated account (Progresso > Aprendizagem)
# Counts, stage distribution, up to three Continue items, eight local weeks of
# evaluated activities, the experiences selectable in the evolution chart (with
# the default selection), completed experiences newest first and up to five
# recent masteries. Weeks and dates use the account's current time zone, or UTC
# when it is absent or unresolvable. Nothing here averages Objetivos.
# Responses: 200 with the body above, 401 without a valid access token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/learning/panorama
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Evolution of one Habilidade experience (the chart's selected series)
# Use a `skillExperienceId` from `evolutionOptions` of the panorama response.
# `points` is chronological: an optional diagnostic base point (`isBaseline`)
# followed by one point per changed official learning result. Review
# evaluations never create points.
# Responses: 200 with the series, 401 without a valid access token, and 404 with
# the same body for an unknown, removed or foreign experience.
GET {{baseUrl}}/learning/panorama/skill-experiences/{{skillExperienceId}}/evolution
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
